  uniform net pressure p (gravity q, vent residual): parabola w = p(a^2-x^2)/2T, curvature p/T = 3.69e-04 1/m at p=q (R = 2.7 km); identical in fold and non-fold zones (no line feature); gravity sag 1.04 um
